---
import Illustration from './Illustration.astro';
import KeywordBanner from './KeywordBanner.astro';
import MoleculeCompare from './MoleculeCompare.astro';
import ScenarioCards from './ScenarioCards.astro';
import { domainGoals, goalLabel } from '../../data/domain-keywords';
import { localeId, localePrefix, pick } from '../../lib/locale';

const id = localeId(Astro.locals.starlightRoute?.lang);
const prefix = localePrefix(id);
const t = (en: string, zh: string) => pick(id, en, zh);
const href = (path: string) => `${prefix}${path}`;

const categories = [
	{
		title: 'GLP-1s',
		titleZh: 'GLP-1 相关',
		text: 'Semaglutide, tirzepatide, retatrutide, and the other incretin names. The GLP-1 page quotes FDA. It is not an efficacy comparison.',
		textZh: '司美格鲁肽、替尔泊肽、瑞他鲁肽以及其他肠促胰素名称。GLP-1 页引用 FDA。它不是疗效对比。',
		href: '/peptides/glp-1-agonists/',
	},
	{
		title: 'Healing names',
		titleZh: '修复讨论中的名称',
		text: 'BPC-157 and TB-500 are filed here. FDA compounding-risk statements only. No repair claim.',
		textZh: 'BPC-157 和 TB-500 归档在这里。只写 FDA 的复配风险表述。不写修复疗效。',
		href: '/peptides/bpc-157/',
	},
	{
		title: 'GH secretagogues',
		titleZh: '生长激素促泌剂',
		text: 'CJC-1295, ipamorelin, and tesamorelin. Tesamorelin’s approval status is still a stub.',
		textZh: 'CJC-1295、ipamorelin 和 tesamorelin。Tesamorelin 的批准状态仍是存根。',
		href: '/peptides/cjc-1295/',
	},
	{
		title: 'Cosmetic and copper',
		titleZh: '美容与铜肽',
		text: 'GHK-Cu. The sourced note is limited to injectable GHK-Cu on FDA’s withdrawn-nomination list.',
		textZh: 'GHK-Cu。有来源的笔记只限于 FDA 撤回清单上的注射用 GHK-Cu。',
		href: '/peptides/ghk-cu/',
	},
	{
		title: 'Nootropic names',
		titleZh: '促认知名称',
		text: 'Semax and Selank have no page yet. The names are not evidence.',
		textZh: 'Semax 和 Selank 还没有页面。名称本身不是证据。',
		stub: true,
	},
];
---

<article class="bh-domain">
	<header class="bh-hero">
		<Illustration name="domain-peptides" wide />
		<KeywordBanner domain="peptides" />
		<h1>{t('Peptides', '肽')}</h1>
		<p class="bh-lead">
			{
				t(
					'On this wiki, “peptide” is the filing label for the named substances in this section. It is not a chemistry proof, and it is not a menu of things to take.',
					'在本维基里，“肽”是这一栏目中那些名称的归档标签。它不是化学证明，也不是服用清单。',
				)
			}
		</p>
		<ul class="bh-goal-row">
			{domainGoals.peptides.map((goal) => <li class:list={['bh-goal', goal]}>{goalLabel(goal, id)}</li>)}
		</ul>
		<p class="bh-note">
			{
				t(
					'Peptides are a first-level domain: short amino-acid chains the body uses as signals. They are split from biochemical molecules because purity, testing, and supply are their own problem. The public path can later map to a peptides subdomain. That DNS name is not configured.',
					'肽是一级领域：身体用来发信号的氨基酸短链。它和生化小分子分开，是因为纯度、检测和供应本身就是问题。公开路径以后可以映射到 peptides 子域名。该 DNS 名称尚未配置。',
				)
			}
		</p>
		<p class="bh-links">
			<a class="bh-button" href="https://veriseas.pages.dev" rel="noopener">
				{t('VeriSeas: prices and lab-test data', 'VeriSeas：价格与检测数据')}
			</a>
			<a class="bh-button ghost" href={href('/biochemical/')}>{t('Biochemical domain', '生物化学领域')}</a>
		</p>
	</header>

	<ScenarioCards slug="peptides" />
	<MoleculeCompare />

	<section class="bh-feature">
		<div>
			<h2>VeriSeas</h2>
			<p>
				{
					t(
						'This wiki does not publish prices or laboratory-test tables. VeriSeas is the catalog for prices and lab-test data. This page does not copy those figures, and a listing there is not a recommendation.',
						'本维基不发布价格或实验室检测表。VeriSeas 是价格与检测数据的目录。本页不抄录那些数字，那里的条目也不是推荐。',
					)
				}
			</p>
			<p>
				<a class="bh-button" href="https://veriseas.pages.dev" rel="noopener">https://veriseas.pages.dev</a>
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>{t('Main categories', '主要类别')}</h2>
		<ul class="bh-grid">
			{
				categories.map((item) => (
					<li class="bh-card">
						<h3>
							{item.href ? (
								<a href={href(item.href)}>{t(item.title, item.titleZh)}</a>
							) : (
								t(item.title, item.titleZh)
							)}
						</h3>
						<p>{t(item.text, item.textZh)}</p>
						{item.stub && <span class="bh-pill stub">{t('Stub', '存根')}</span>}
					</li>
				))
			}
		</ul>
		<p>
			<a href={href('/peptides/tb-500/')}>{t('TB-500 page', 'TB-500 页')}</a>
			{' · '}
			<a href={href('/peptides/ipamorelin/')}>Ipamorelin</a>
			{' · '}
			<a href={href('/peptides/tesamorelin/')}>Tesamorelin</a>
		</p>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>{t('Evidence and regulatory status', '证据与监管状态')}</h2>
		<p>
			{
				t(
					'FDA’s unapproved-GLP-1 page discusses semaglutide and tirzepatide as GLP-1 drugs that also circulate in unapproved versions, and it says those unapproved versions are not reviewed for safety, effectiveness, and quality before marketing. The same page says retatrutide and cagrilintide cannot be used in compounding, are not components of FDA-approved drugs, and have not been found safe and effective for any condition.',
					'FDA 的未经批准 GLP-1 页面把司美格鲁肽和替尔泊肽作为也在未经批准版本中流通的 GLP-1 药物来讨论，并说这些未经批准的版本在上市前不经过安全性、有效性和质量审评。同一页说，瑞他鲁肽和 cagrilintide 不能用于复配，不是已批准药物的成分，也没有被认定对任何病症安全有效。',
				)
			}
		</p>
		<p>
			{
				t(
					'On the compounding-risk page, BPC-157, TB-500 (thymosin beta-4 fragment), CJC-1295, injectable GHK-Cu, MOTS-c, and melanotan II appear among nominations that were withdrawn. That is not an efficacy finding. Details stay on each substance page.',
					'在复配风险页面上，BPC-157、TB-500（胸腺素 β4 片段）、CJC-1295、注射用 GHK-Cu、MOTS-c 和 melanotan II 出现在已撤回的提名中。这不是疗效结论。细节留在各物质页。',
				)
			}
		</p>
		<p>
			<a href={href('/peptides/glp-1-agonists/')}>{t('GLP-1 page', 'GLP-1 页')}</a>
			{' · '}
			<a href={href('/regulation/')}>{t('Regulation section', '法规栏目')}</a>
		</p>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>{t('Quality and testing risks', '质量与检测风险')}</h2>
		<p>
			{
				t(
					'The quality point this page is willing to repeat is the one FDA states: unapproved versions are not reviewed for quality before marketing. This wiki does not publish a purity cutoff. How to read a certificate of analysis is still a stub.',
					'本页愿意重复的质量要点只有 FDA 写明的那句：未经批准的版本在上市前不经过质量审评。本维基不发布纯度切点。如何阅读检验报告仍是存根。',
				)
			}
		</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<a href={href('/peptides/reading-a-coa/')}>{t('Reading a certificate of analysis', '阅读检验报告')}</a>
			</li>
			<li>
				<a href={href('/peptides/lyophilized-handling/')}>{t('Lyophilized peptides', '冻干肽')}</a>
			</li>
			<li>
				<a href={href('/regulation/import-alert-66-80/')}>{t('Import Alert 66-80', '进口警报 66-80')}</a>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>{t('Not peptides', '不是肽')}</h2>
		<p>
			{
				t(
					'NAD+, creatine, metformin, and rapamycin are often mentioned beside peptides. This wiki does not file them as peptides. A compound-record citation for each structure is not attached here, so this is a filing rule, not a chemistry proof.',
					'项目笔记常把 NAD+、肌酸、二甲双胍和雷帕霉素跟肽放在一起说。本维基不把它们归档为肽。这里没有附上每种分子的化合物记录，因此这是归档规则，不是化学证明。',
				)
			}
		</p>
		<p>
			{
				t(
					'This page does not give doses, titration schedules, injection technique, preparation steps, or a shopping list.',
					'本页不提供剂量、滴定方案、注射操作、配制步骤，也不提供购物清单。',
				)
			}
		</p>
	</section>
</article>
